---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CV — Chungsiang Roeurn" showHeader={false}>
	<section class="page-shell">
		<a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to overview</a>
		<div class="header-box role-header-box">
			<p class="eyebrow">Curriculum vitae</p>
			<h1 class="section-title">Roeurn Chungsiang</h1>
			<p class="description">Frontend, backend API, and desktop developer building practical software systems and Telegram integrations.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="details-box mt-3">
			<div class="cv-section">
				<p class="eyebrow">Summary</p>
				<p class="cv-copy">Developer with hands-on experience across frontend web, backend APIs, mobile products, and desktop applications. I work with React, Next.js, TypeScript, REST and GraphQL integrations, databases, and Telegram Mini Apps, with a strong focus on responsive interfaces, clean architecture, and dependable product workflows.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="cv-section">
				<p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
				<div class="detail-list mt-5">
					<div class="detail-item"><span>06-2026 — now</span><div><strong>Frontend Desktop Developer · VPS.Start Technology</strong><p>Building and improving desktop applications with a focus on clear workflows, reliable behavior, and maintainable systems.</p></div></div>
					<div class="detail-item"><span>11-2025 — 03-2026</span><div><strong>Junior Mobile Developer · Nano Sound Cambodia</strong><p>For four months, maintained an e-commerce mobile application and system, developed Telegram Mini Apps, integrated GraphQL APIs, and explored microservices and ERP workflows.</p></div></div>
					<div class="detail-item"><span>08-2024 — 07-2025</span><div><strong>Web Developer · dreamsLAB</strong><p>Contributed to real company projects, worked with CMS platforms, and learned modern development tools during a three-month frontend internship.</p></div></div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="cv-section">
				<p class="eyebrow">Education</p>
				<div class="detail-list mt-5">
					<div class="detail-item"><span>03-2023 — 03-2026</span><div><strong>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</strong><p>Royal University of Phnom Penh</p></div></div>
					<div class="detail-item"><span>02-2023 — 06-2024</span><div><strong>Diploma of English Program</strong><p>Paññāsāstra University of Cambodia</p></div></div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="cv-section cv-columns">
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Technical skills</p><p class="cv-copy mt-4">React.js · Next.js · TypeScript · JavaScript · Astro.js · Tailwind CSS · ShadCN UI · React Native · C# · WPF · XAML · MVVM · REST APIs · GraphQL · Apollo Client · PostgreSQL · MySQL · SQLite · Supabase · Git · GitHub · Postman · Figma</p></div>
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Languages</p><p class="cv-copy mt-4">Khmer — Native<br />English — Fluent<br />Chinese — Learning</p></div>
			</div>

			<div class="cv-section cv-columns">
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Strengths</p><p class="cv-copy mt-4">Problem solving · Fast learning · Team collaboration · UI/UX understanding · Responsive design · API integration · Database management · Deployment basics · SEO optimization</p></div>
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Certificates</p><p class="cv-copy mt-4">Git and GitHub · Complete Next.js From Scratch · Basic Web Design Training · Fullstack Development Training · Web Developer Internship</p></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
